  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Calamari in the air fryer works if you follow two rules: dry the squid rings completely before coating, and cook in a single layer. Crowding the basket traps steam and the coating goes soft. If your air fryer basket is small, cook in two batches. The squid itself only needs 6-8 minutes ,  it overcooks to rubber very quickly above that."
          }
        ]
      },
